      "chunk_id": "4f057818-24db-49a8-be3b-73811b3d858c",
      "content": "Approved Talk Track\n\nNorthstar helps operations leaders see where work slows down, which approvals are delayed, and which data quality issues affect business reporting. Sales Representatives should avoid promising product roadmap commitments.",
